	)
	(text
		"DESIGN NOTES\nInputs survive 0-60 V and reverse battery: 1206 series resistors (200 V), BAT54S clamps, RC filter.\nPANIC: SOS switch to chassis GND (AIS-140 emergency button). IGN/DIN1: 12/24 V active high.\nDOUT1: low-side immobiliser relay driver, flyback D13 to VIN_PROT.\nIMU wake-on-motion -> IO14 (theft alert), crash = >6 g peak + tilt > 60 deg (firmware).\nRV-3028 EVI pin time-stamps lid opening (TAMPER_N) even with the MCU asleep."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5376753c-eb6b-5365-b3f3-5d50bc7356b4")
	)
	(text
		"PART NOTES (VERIFY = check against vendor datasheet before release)\nU15: Wake-on-motion, tilt/fall + crash (+-16 g) detection\nR42: 14.4 V -> 2.6 V; IGN > ~7 V reads high\nR48: 0-30 V -> 0-2.73 V (ADC1_CH3)\nR50: holds IO46 strap low at boot"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 219.71 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9225e115-7af9-5423-bdbb-ca9f599a681e")
	)
)
